results/telemetry/sessions/reviewer-pr0001-20260830-01.last.md:29:F2. In `references/qpbt-paper/06_nonlocal_games_and_mipstar.tex:94-103`, label `lem:symmetric-strat`, the argument starts with a strategy for every `ε' > ε`. Neither it nor lines 110-122 produce a finite-dimensional strategy attaining `val*`, which line 74 defines as a supremum. State the approximate conclusion or supply an actual attainment theorem.
