results/telemetry/sessions/reviewer-pr0001-20260830-01.last.md-31-F3. Primary label `lem:ld-sandwich` at `references/qpbt-paper/06_nonlocal_games_and_mipstar.tex:465-495` contains the same transposition, but the cited `references/neexp-paper/05_quantum_preliminaries.tex:952-973`, label `fact:low-degree-sandwich`, uses `G^k_{g_k}⋯G^1_{g_1}⋯G^k_{g_k}`. The current `G^k_{g_1}` is undefined when the outcome types differ; `k = 0` is also undefined. Apply the documented local correction and handle the empty case.
