results/telemetry/sessions/reviewer-pr0001-20260830-01.last.md-33-F4. Source label `def:graph-distribution` at `references/qpbt-paper/07_types.tex:65-82` has the same boundary omission. With no edges, `m = k = 0`, so `1/(2m-k)` is undefined and the displayed mass is not a probability distribution. Require a nonempty edge set.
